description: "Trade-based money-laundering Link Analysis showcase - One row per registered company: invented name, country (ISO code), registered address (blank on about 4 %; a formation-agent address and a business centre each host many companies), incorporation date and the company's bank account. Landed by the company Pipeline. Synthetic."
